Infantry_Mascot vendors the drawing code of material-mascot.

  Source:  https://github.com/maxmaster55/material-mascot
  Commit:  5d6e0e0d57b1660645f216274d4de2e1954f1ef1
  License: MIT, Copyright (C) 2026 Max Master (full text in LICENSE-MIT)
  Vendored: mascot/src/commonMain engine/, config/ and ui/MaterialBot.kt, into src/vendor/mascot/.
  Not vendored: live/ (status bus, shake sensor, stage) and the Android samples.

Changes to the upstream files (everything else is verbatim):
  - engine/BotEngine.kt, BotFace.kt, BotMath.kt: java.lang.Math.PI -> kotlin.math.PI (common, wasm has no Math).
  - ui/MaterialBot.kt: new parameter `frozen` (draw one frame, no frame loop: the "static" motion mode);
    the frame clock is seeded with 0 instead of System.nanoTime() (JVM-only, wasm cannot compile it).
